格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Shopify plugin for DeepSeek Harness: 213 model-facing shopify_* tools over the Shopify Admin REST + GraphQL APIs (products, orders, customers, inventory, fulfillments, discounts, content, webhooks, themes, billing, bulk operations) with Admin API access-token auth.","id":"gh:1347145063","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-shopify-plugins","slug":"sakthiveltofficial/dsh-shopify-plugins","topics":["agent-tools","ai-agents","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-shopify","ecommerce","shopify","shopify-api"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Shopify plugin for DeepSeek Harness: 213 model-facing shopify_* tools over the Shopify Admin REST + "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"GraphQL APIs (products, orders, customers, inventory, fulfillments, discounts, content, webhooks, th"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"emes, billing, bulk operations) with Admin API access-token auth."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-shopify · Shopify Plugin for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A complete, production-ready **Shopify plugin for DeepSeek Harness (DSH)**. It gives the agent typed"},{"id":"p3s2","text":", policy-aware access to the Shopify **Admin REST + GraphQL APIs** — **210+ model-facing tools** cov"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"ering products, orders, customers, collections, inventory, fulfillments, discounts, content, metafie"},{"id":"p3s4","text":"lds, webhooks, themes, draft orders, marketing, gift cards, billing, bulk operations, and a generic "},{"id":"p3s5","text":"GraphQL escape hatch — with Admin API access-token auth resolved through DSH's credential service."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> **Official ecosystem keyword:** this is a `dsh-plugin` — add the `dsh-plugin` GitHub topic to this"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" ecosystem keyword:** this is a `dsh-plugin` — add the `dsh-plugin` GitHub topic to this repository."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> **Where this came from:** the tool surface is distilled from the Composio `SHOPIFY` integration (4"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"07 actions). Most of those 407 are deprecated duplicates and legacy REST aliases; this plugin keeps "},{"id":"p5s3","text":"the **current, non-deprecated operation per capability** and adds the GraphQL-first surfaces (new pr"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"oduct model, write presets, bulk operations), so ~213 tools cover the same workflows with one canoni"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"e presets, bulk operations), so ~213 tools cover the same workflows with one canonical tool per job."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## 🤖 LLM-readable summary"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- **What:** a single Cordis plugin that extends DSH agents with 210+ `shopify_*` tools over the Shop"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ify Admin API.\n- **Install:** `dsh plugin --profile web add github:sakthiveltofficial/dsh-shopify-pl"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"ugins`, then add one row to your profile patch (or agent preset) — see Install.\n- **Tools:** `shopif"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"y_list_products`, `shopify_get_order`, `shopify_list_orders`, `shopify_search_customers`, `shopify_s"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"et_inventory_level`, `shopify_create_fulfillment`, `shopify_create_price_rule`, `shopify_set_metafie"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"lds`, `shopify_graphql_admin_execute`, `shopify_run_bulk_operation_query`, and 200 more — full catal"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"og in the tool table.\n- **Auth:** Admin API access token (custom app) — no OAuth redirect needed. Cr"},{"id":"p7s8","text":"edentials are **never stored in config**: env-var references resolved per operation via `ctx.credent"},{"id":"p7s9","text":"ials` (`SHOPIFY_SHOP_DOMAIN` + `SHOPIFY_ADMIN_API_TOKEN`, fallback `SHOPIFY_ACCESS_TOKEN`).\n- **Runt"},{"id":"p7s10","text":"ime requirements:** DeepSeek Harness, Node.js ≥ 20 (global `fetch`), and a Shopify store with a cust"},{"id":"p7s11","text":"om app that has the Admin API scopes your workflows need.\n- **Safety:** destructive tools (`shopify_"},{"id":"p7s12","text":"delete_product`, `shopify_delete_order`, `shopify_delete_customer`, `shopify_delete_custom_collectio"},{"id":"p7s13","text":"n`, `shopify_disable_gift_card`, ...) are clearly labeled and require explicit user confirmation; th"},{"id":"p7s14","text":"e agent is prompted to confirm before irreversible actions.\n- **License:** MIT."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## ✨ What it does"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- **Products** — list/get/create/update/delete products and variants, product images, counts; GraphQ"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"L product-model presets (options, media, publishing).\n- **Orders** — get/list/count/create/update/ca"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"ncel/close/delete orders, customer order history, transactions, refunds (calculate → create), order "},{"id":"p9s4","text":"risks.\n- **Customers** — list/get/search/count/create/update/delete customers, addresses (incl. bulk"},{"id":"p9s5","text":" delete + set default), account-activation URLs.\n- **Collections** — custom + smart collections CRUD"},{"id":"p9s6","text":" and counts, add/remove products (collects), collection product listings.\n- **Inventory** — location"},{"id":"p9s7","text":"s, inventory items, inventory levels (get/set/adjust/connect/delete).\n- **Fulfillments** — fulfillme"},{"id":"p9s8","text":"nt orders (get, move, hold/release, deadlines), fulfillments (create/cancel/tracking), fulfillment e"},{"id":"p9s9","text":"vents, fulfillment services.\n- **Discounts** — price rules CRUD + counts, discount codes (CRUD, look"},{"id":"p9s10","text":"up, count, async batches).\n- **Draft orders** — list/get/create/update/delete/complete, send invoice"},{"id":"p9s11","text":".\n- **Content** — blogs, articles, comments, pages (full CRUD + counts, moderation).\n- **Metafields "},{"id":"p9s12","text":"& metaobjects** — resource-scoped metafields, `metafieldsSet`/`metafieldsDelete` (GraphQL).\n- **Webh"},{"id":"p9s13","text":"ooks** — list/get/create/update/delete/count subscriptions + GraphQL presets.\n- **Themes** — themes "},{"id":"p9s14","text":"CRUD, theme assets (get/list/upsert/delete).\n- **Marketing** — marketing events CRUD, engagements.\n-"},{"id":"p9s15","text":" **Gift cards** — list/get/create/update/disable/search.\n- **Redirects & script tags** — full CRUD.\n"},{"id":"p9s16","text":"- **Billing** — app subscriptions (create/cancel/update line item), one-time application charges.\n- "},{"id":"p9s17","text":"**Shop & config** — shop details (incl. `iana_timezone`), policies, currencies, shipping zones, coun"},{"id":"p9s18","text":"tries/provinces, access scopes, GraphQL shop query.\n- **Power tools** — `shopify_graphql_admin_execu"},{"id":"p9s19","text":"te` (any Admin GraphQL document), `shopify_graphql_write_operations` (30 curated mutation presets), "},{"id":"p9s20","text":"bulk query operations (run/get/cancel/list/current).\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## 🚀 Install"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### Prerequisites"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### 1. Install the package from your GitHub repository"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"This installs the `@shopify/dsh-shopify` plugin package into the profile (the repo root is the packa"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ge — no build step needed)."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### 2. Mount the plugin in a composition"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"The plugin publishes no services — it only registers tools into the host `tools` registry — so it mo"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"unts as a plain loose row, with no `isolate` realm required."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"**Option A — profile patch (host plane, tools visible to every agent).** Append to your profile's `c"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"ile patch (host plane, tools visible to every agent).** Append to your profile's `cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"**Option B — agent preset (tools only for agents on that preset).** Add the row to the preset's `age"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"nt.cordis.yml` (see `examples/agent.cordis.yml`):"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Restart the profile (or the DSH process)."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### Verify"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Then ask the agent: *\"what shopify tools do you have?\"* — it should list the `shopify_*` tools (210+"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"e agent: *\"what shopify tools do you have?\"* — it should list the `shopify_*` tools (210+ in total)."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## 🔑 Configure credentials (Admin API access token)"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
